Client-core jars go here.

The launcher looks in this directory for the jar named by a template in
launcher/src/main/profiles.ts — <repo>/artifacts in development, and
<resourcesPath>/artifacts in a packaged build.

Nothing needs to be here. A template whose jar is missing launches as plain
(modded) Minecraft and says so in the log; the instance card says so before
anything is downloaded. That is a supported outcome, not a broken install.
